Distribution repository
========================

This repository is a distribution point. It contains documentation and release
manifests only; it contains no source code.

Each program distributed through the Releases of this repository is governed by its
own licence, which is included with that program's installer and/or stated in that
tool's own repository. Nothing in this repository grants any licence to any program
beyond what that program's own licence provides.

The documentation and manifest files in this repository are provided as-is, without
warranty of any kind.
